</article>
<article class="item" id="2026-11-22-pmid-43035971">
  <div class="tagrow"><span class="tag">鼻整形</span><span class="tag">肋软骨</span><span class="tag">患者报告结局</span></div>
  <h2><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43035971/" rel="noopener">Patient-Reported Functional and Cosmetic Outcomes after Rhinoplasty with Autologous Versus Cadaveric Rib Cartilage Grafts</a></h2>
  <div class="journal">Facial Plastic Surgery &amp; Aesthetic Medicine · Du DK · PMID 43035971 · <a href="https://doi.org/10.1177/26893614261499033" rel="noopener">doi</a><span class="affil">Washington University School of Medicine in St. Louis, St. Louis, Missouri, USA</span></div>
  <p class="line fact"><b>事实｜</b>129 例鼻整形队列，33 例自体、96 例异体肋软骨，95.3% 作撑开移植物。调整模型示自体组鼻塞更低（差值 −14.02，95%CI −24.19 至 −3.85），外观相近；翻修率 15.2% 对 24.0%。</p>
  <p class="line take"><b>点评｜</b>创新点：把自体与异体肋软骨放进同一纵向患者报告结局模型，129 例是目前该问题较大的对比样本。意义：功能诉求强的患者可优先考虑自体肋软骨；翻修率差 8.8 个百分点但置信区间跨零，交代时只能说是趋势，不能承诺更低。</p>
  <p class="en">This retrospective cohort followed 129 adults undergoing rhinoplasty between 2018 and 2025, 33 with autologous and 96 with cadaveric rib cartilage, used mainly as spreader grafts (95.3%). Adjusted mixed-effects models showed lower mean obstruction scores across follow-up in autologous recipients (difference -14.02; 95% CI -24.19 to -3.85) with similar cosmetic scores (-7.05; 95% CI -16.33 to 2.22), and revisions occurred in 15.2% versus 24.0%. It places autologous and cadaveric rib grafts in one longitudinal patient-reported outcome model, and 129 patients is a comparatively large sample for this question. Where breathing is the priority, autologous rib has the functional edge; the 8.8-point revision gap has a confidence interval crossing zero, so consent should present it as a trend rather than a promise.</p>
  <div class="comments"><p style="color:#8a8a8a;font-size:13px;margin:6px 0">还没有批注</p></div>
